<title>THAILAND: Thai stocks rally 2.05 pct on bank, finance buying.</title>
<headline>Thai stocks rally 2.05 pct on bank, finance buying.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thai stocks advanced strongly on active trade as investors continued buying finance, bank and communication stocks, brokers said.</p>
<p>The SET index rose 13.01 points, or 2.05 percent, to 648.72 on four billion baht turnover at 0505 GMT.</p>
<p>-- Suthep Chawla (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
